1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,900
Hello and welcome to this module of an introduction to virus management.
大家好，欢迎来到生物风险管理导论的这一单元。

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:10,400
Today we will be demonstrating to you on the usage of the PEPL.
今天我们将向大家演示 PAPR 的使用方法。

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:16,900
This is a powered air purified respirator which is designated as a PAPR.
这是一种动力送风过滤式呼吸器，简称 PAPR。

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:25,900
The PAPR consists of a helmet which is mounted with a filter which will filter out most pathogens.
PAPR 由一个头盔组成，头盔上装有过滤器，可以滤除大部分病原体。

5
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:29,900
It also has a shroud and it is a self-continuing.
它还带有一个头罩，并且是自给式的。

6
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:35,900
Now the way in which this functions is that the air is pulled in through this side.
它的工作原理是：空气从这一侧被吸进来，

7
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:40,400
It passes through this filter and a fan will create a down drop on your face.
经过这个过滤器，然后风扇会在你的面部形成向下的气流。

8
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:44,400
Now these respirators need to be powered by a battery pack.
这类呼吸器需要由电池组供电。

9
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:47,400
So I will demonstrate the usage of this video.
下面我来演示它的使用方法。

10
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:50,400
Wearing a belt. This is the belt.
先系上腰带。这就是腰带。

11
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:56,400
You need to adjust this belt because once it is inside your direct suit.
你需要调整好这条腰带，因为一旦它进入你的防护服里面，

12
00:00:56,400 --> 00:01:03,400
You will no longer have access to this belt module.
你就再也够不到这个腰带组件了。

13
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:06,400
The second one you need to know about is this battery.
第二个你需要了解的是这块电池。

14
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:13,400
This is a battery. So please ensure that your battery is recharged prior to each laboratory experiment.
这是电池。所以请确保在每次实验室实验之前都给电池充好电。

15
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:17,400
I am going to fit this on my belt.
我要把它装到我的腰带上。

16
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:21,400
Now if you notice the MaxA has a shroud.
大家注意，MaxAir 带有一个头罩。

17
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:28,400
This shroud can be recycled by basically decontaminating this.
这个头罩基本上可以通过去污处理后重复使用。

18
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:31,400
But it is also recommended in case of a spill.
但也建议，如果发生溢洒，

19
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:35,400
You need to replace this with another shroud.
你需要换一个新的头罩。

20
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:43,400
This is the wire and if you look inside you will see an adjustment for the headband.
这是导线，如果你往里面看，会看到头带的调节装置。

21
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:48,400
So once you have worn your high max suit. You have to wear this like this.
所以在你穿好防护服之后，你要像这样把它戴上。

22
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:53,400
So please ensure that you have fitted your power.
所以请确保你已经接好了电源。

23
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:57,400
Or else you will suffocate. I am going to turn on the power.
否则你会窒息。我现在要打开电源。

24
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,400
Now the power is on.
现在电源已经打开了。

25
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:02,400
And when the power is on you will see 3 lights here.
电源打开时，你会看到这里有 3 个指示灯，

26
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,400
Which is indicating power off.
表示电源关闭。

27
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:07,400
So this battery will last for around 6 hours.
这块电池大约能用 6 个小时。

28
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:10,400
After which you will have to recharge this battery.
之后你就需要给电池充电。

29
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:12,400
Ok so I am going to wear this now.
好，我现在要把它戴上。

30
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,400
Ok I have mounted this.
好，我已经戴好了。

31
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,400
You can see how it is worn.
大家可以看到它是怎么戴的。

32
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:19,400
That is how it looks all around.
从各个角度看就是这个样子。

33
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:23,400
And then you are done.
然后就完成了。

34
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,400
So this is the basic setup for the truck.
这就是这套装置的基本佩戴方法。

35
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,400
If you want to take it off.
如果你要把它摘下来，

36
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:29,400
Do it this way.
就这样做。

37
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:36,930
And you keep on running until it is off.
然后一直转，直到它关掉为止。

38
00:02:36,930 --> 00:02:39,930
And then you disconnect the battery.
然后断开电池。

39
00:02:39,930 --> 00:02:42,930
Ok generally after every biosafety procedure.
好，一般来说，每次生物安全操作之后，

40
00:02:42,930 --> 00:02:47,930
This helmet will be decontaminated using a surface decont.
这个头盔都要用表面去污剂进行去污。

41
00:02:47,930 --> 00:02:50,930
And in some cases we will change this route.
在某些情况下，我们还会更换这个头罩。

42
00:02:50,930 --> 00:02:53,930
And after completion of your procedure.
在你的操作完成之后，

43
00:02:53,930 --> 00:02:56,930
Please ensure that your battery is charged.
请确保给电池充好电。

44
00:02:56,930 --> 00:03:00,930
Ok that is a brief introduction to the max air system which we use.
好，以上就是对我们所用的 MaxAir 系统的简要介绍。

45
00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:02,930
It is a powered air purified respirator.
它是一种动力送风过滤式呼吸器。

46
00:03:02,930 --> 00:03:04,930
Thank you very much for watching.
非常感谢收看。
